  m_text: '1. OCEAN EXPLORATION

    Travel across the ocean for 20 seconds. Then answer five quiz questions to survive.


    2. ANSWER QUESTIONS

    Choose the correct answer before the 15-second question timer runs out.


    3. PROTECT YOUR BOAT

    Your boat starts with 100 HP. Wrong answers or timeouts cause 20 HP damage. Avoid sinking!


    4. EXPLORE THE ISLAND

    Reach an island to explore. Ocean quiz timers stop while you are on land.


    5. FIND TREASURES

    Discover treasure chests and answer questions to earn random rewards. Use your items to help you survive.'
